  <wpt lat="46.648181984201074" lon="-71.932418961077929">
    <ele>0</ele>
    <time>2026-06-27T16:35:51Z</time>
    <name>Auberge de l'Ouest</name>
    <cmt>description: This tourist accommodation offers&lt;br&gt;4 units&lt;br&gt;Cycling packages&lt;br&gt;Laundry room&lt;br&gt;Breakfast,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, as a Bienvenue cyclistes!-certified tourist accommodation, it offers&lt;br&gt;*A pump and basic tools for minor repairs&lt;br&gt;A covered, locked location to store your bicycle at night&lt;br&gt;Information about local bicycle networks and cycling services in the area&lt;br&gt;https://www.routeverte.com/en/hebergements/auberge-de-louest-2/&lt;br&gt;hostel&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;"At the heart&lt;br&gt;of your passion&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether you come from near or far, the village of Deschambault is the ideal stopover for an invigorating break. As members of the Welcome Cyclists network, we put at your disposal everything you need for your refuelling on your bike journey. Enjoy lunches featuring local products, get a secure garage for storing your bikes, and find the basic tools needed for possible repairs. We are determined to make your stay as practical as memorable."&lt;br&gt;https://www.aubergedelouest.com/&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation</cmt>
    <desc>description: This tourist accommodation offers&lt;br&gt;4 units&lt;br&gt;Cycling packages&lt;br&gt;Laundry room&lt;br&gt;Breakfast,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, as a Bienvenue cyclistes!-certified tourist accommodation, it offers&lt;br&gt;*A pump and basic tools for minor repairs&lt;br&gt;A covered, locked location to store your bicycle at night&lt;br&gt;Information about local bicycle networks and cycling services in the area&lt;br&gt;https://www.routeverte.com/en/hebergements/auberge-de-louest-2/&lt;br&gt;hostel&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;"At the heart&lt;br&gt;of your passion&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether you come from near or far, the village of Deschambault is the ideal stopover for an invigorating break. As members of the Welcome Cyclists network, we put at your disposal everything you need for your refuelling on your bike journey. Enjoy lunches featuring local products, get a secure garage for storing your bikes, and find the basic tools needed for possible repairs. We are determined to make your stay as practical as memorable."&lt;br&gt;https://www.aubergedelouest.com/&lt;br&gt;Type: Approved Accommodation</desc>
    <sym>Lodging</sym>
    <type>user</type>
